        "Provenance: eqemu peq.skill_caps, exported from the live WillEQ test server on 2026-08-20",
        "by collapsing 58359 raw rows (16 classes, 76 skills, levels 1-105) to one row per",
        "(class_id, skill_id): first_level = MIN(level) with cap>0, max_cap = MAX(cap).",
        "A (class_id, skill_id) pair ABSENT from the caps map means that class can NEVER have that",
        "skill, at any level. That absence -- not the level threshold -- is what gates activation.",
        "max_cap is the LIFETIME cap for the class, NOT the cap at the player current level: the",
        "per-level curve was collapsed out of this export and cannot be recovered from it.",
        "first_level is recorded for information; it is deliberately NOT a gate -- T158 observed a",
        "level-10 Rogue apply poison successfully with skill 0, far under the level-18 first_level,",
        "because eqemu Handle_OP_ApplyPoison checks class and item, never HasSkill."
